<figure class="diagram">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 758 236" role="img" aria-label="The product cycle from discovery to ship, with AI applied at specification where volume is high and an error is cheap. The credit decision sits outside that boundary.">
    <defs>
      <marker id="ch" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z" fill="currentColor"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <text x="0" y="12" class="dlabel" fill="currentColor" opacity=".65">Product cycle</text>
    <g class="d-step" style="--i:0">
      <rect x="0" y="26" width="140" height="42" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></rect>
      <text x="70" y="52" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor">Discovery</text>
    </g>
    <g class="d-step d-key" style="--i:1">
      <rect x="176" y="26" width="140" height="42" rx="6" fill="var(--lapis)" stroke="var(--lapis)" stroke-width="1"></rect>
      <text x="246" y="52" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--paper)" font-weight="500">Specification</text>
    </g>
    <g class="d-step" style="--i:2">
      <rect x="352" y="26" width="140" height="42" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></rect>
      <text x="422" y="52" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor">Build</text>
    </g>
    <g class="d-step" style="--i:3">
      <rect x="528" y="26" width="140" height="42" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></rect>
      <text x="598" y="52" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor">Ship</text>
    </g>
    <line class="d-flow" x1="140" y1="47" x2="172" y2="47" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#ch)"></line>
    <line class="d-flow d-flow-key" x1="316" y1="47" x2="348" y2="47" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#ch)"></line>
    <line class="d-flow" x1="492" y1="47" x2="524" y2="47" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#ch)"></line>
    <path class="d-flow d-flow-key" d="M 246 68 L 246 92" fill="none" stroke="var(--lapis)" stroke-width="1.6"></path>
    <g class="d-step d-key" style="--i:4">
      <rect x="118" y="92" width="256" height="58" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="var(--lapis)" stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
      <text x="246" y="112" font-size="11.5" text-anchor="middle" fill="var(--lapis)" font-weight="500">AI APPLIED HERE</text>
      <text x="246" y="128" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor">PRDs from codebase · ERP queries</text>
      <text x="246" y="142" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor" opacity=".75">high volume · error is cheap · human reviews</text>
    </g>
    <line x1="0" y1="176" x2="758" y2="176" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" opacity=".18"></line>
    <g class="d-step" style="--i:5">
      <rect x="0" y="192" width="200" height="38" rx="6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3" opacity=".6"></rect>
      <text x="100" y="216" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor" opacity=".8">Credit decision</text>
    </g>
    <text x="220" y="209" font-size="11.5" fill="currentColor" opacity=".75">deliberately excluded: a confident wrong answer</text>
    <text x="220" y="224" font-size="11.5" fill="currentColor" opacity=".75">costs a farmer a season</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    The boundary is the decision, not the enthusiasm. AI sits where work is repetitive, high-volume and reviewed before it reaches anyone; it stays out of the one place where being confidently wrong is expensive and irreversible.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
